codex
The failure is the audit sandbox’s PID/procfs mismatch, not the generated project: Lean resolves its executable through `/proc/<pid>/exe`, but the process sees a nested PID absent from the mounted `/proc`. I’m applying a narrow, reviewer-authored runtime shim that only supplies the executable path for that lookup, then rerunning the unchanged trusted preflight and recording the shim source and hash.
